[$media/ee23a45/man-lion-200x200.jpg [align right] [width 200px]]

A man walked into the lion lying on the steel deck, and stroked the lion's back.

The lion released a low and long roar, and rubbed its head against man's waist.

They walked away, shoulder by shoulder, to the sunset river.

